Third-party provenance
----------------------
`packages/core` has zero runtime dependencies and vendors no third-party code.

Algorithms implemented from public specifications:

  - Thai national ID check digit — weighted mod-11, public administrative
    specification.
  - (planned) SHA-256 and HMAC-SHA256 — to be implemented from FIPS 180-4 and
    RFC 2104, verified against RFC 4231 and NIST CAVP vectors. Implemented from
    the specification rather than adapted from an existing codebase, so that
    this file does not need to carry another project's licence.

Datasets bundled with the library record their source and licence in
data/LICENCES.md.
